OL,5,G2100 James May's Great Explorers
OL,6,     FIn his unique style, James
OL,7,     Fexplores Captain Cook's rise to
OL,8,     Fnaval captain and his legacy -
OL,9,     Feven experiencing first-hand his
OL,10,     Fown apprenticeship aboard a tall
OL,11,     Fship. (Ep3/3)
OL,12,G2225 Into the Amazon with Robson Green
OL,13,     FThe conclusion of Robson's Amazon
OL,14,     Fadventure features the beautiful
OL,15,     FAnavilhanas Archipelago, fishing
OL,16,     Fwith bow and arrow, a visit to an
OL,17,     Findigenous tribe and pink
OL,18,     Fdolphins. (Ep3/3)
