OL,5,G2325 Prisoner: Cell Block H
OL,6,     FLizzie is 'welcomed' back to
OL,7,     FWentworth by Vera with her usual
OL,8,     Fcompassion. In maternity, Chrissie
OL,9,     Fand Jane are beginning to resent
OL,10,     FDoreen's interference.
OL,11,G0030 Prisoner: Cell Block H
OL,12,     FVera blames Jim's rosters for her
OL,13,     Fbeing a physical wreck. Bob admits
OL,14,     Fhe is seeing Meg when Tracey
OL,15,     Fchallenges him. Doreen is
OL,16,     Finterviewed by Dr Henderson.
OL,17,G0130 Autopsy
OL,18,     FThe world learned on June 8, 2018,
OL,19,     Fthat Anthony Bourdain had died by
OL,20,     Fsuicide. This episode examines the
OL,21,     Fbeloved chef, travel writer and
OL,22,     Fdocumentarian's final days. (Ep23)
